{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOEC0huA","is_bot":false,"login":"claudebounty","name":""},"body":"## 💰 Bounty: $50 — powered by [Opire](https://opire.dev)\n\n## Description\nCreate a Claude Code skill (`SKILL.md`) or a bash script that automatically generates\na structured `CHANGELOG.md` from a project's git history.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Works via `/generate-changelog` command or `bash changelog.sh`\n- [ ] Fetches commits since the last git tag\n- [ ] Auto-categorizes into: `Added` / `Fixed` / `Changed` / `Removed`\n- [ ] Outputs a properly formatted `CHANGELOG.md`\n- [ ] Tested on a real GitHub repo (include a sample output in the PR)\n- [ ] README with setup instructions in 3 steps or fewer\n\n## How to Claim\n1. Comment `/opire try` in this issue\n2. Submit a PR with your solution\n3. Payment is released automatically on merge ✅\n\n## Accepted Stack\nBash, Python, or native Claude Code `SKILL.md`.","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72uqLP","author":{"login":"zhaog100"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt","createdAt":"2026-03-27T01:30:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139426511","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72u_nh","author":{"login":"ElromEvedElElyon"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nI'll build this CHANGELOG skill using bash + conventional commit parsing. PR incoming shortly.","createdAt":"2026-03-27T01:53:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139514337","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72vjP9","author":{"login":"ElromEvedElElyon"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-03-27T02:25:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139660285","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72vpBE","author":{"login":"zhaog100"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt","createdAt":"2026-03-27T02:30:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139683908","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72v-f5","author":{"login":"wills123"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-03-27T02:50:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139771897","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wDZo","author":{"login":"disillusi0n"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-03-27T02:56:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139791976","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wHEp","author":{"login":"TateLyman"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nI'll build this as a Claude Code skill. Have extensive experience with git log parsing and changelog generation. PR incoming shortly.","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:00:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139807017","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wSFS","author":{"login":"zicaiw625"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nTaking this one.\n\nSubmitting a native Claude Code skill plus shell script that:\n- finds the last git tag\n- categorizes commits into Added / Fixed / Changed / Removed\n- generates a `CHANGELOG.md`\n- includes a sample generated changelog from a real repo\n\nPR next.\n","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:15:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139852114","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wY2K","author":{"login":"ljapptest-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:24:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139879818","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wY2O","author":{"login":"ljapptest-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 📝 CHANGELOG Generator Submission\n\nI've created a complete git history CHANGELOG generator.\n\n### ✅ Deliverables\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/generate-changelog\n\n### ✅ Acceptance Criteria Met\n\n- [x] **Works via command**: `./generate-changelog.sh` or `python generate_changelog.py`\n- [x] **Fetches commits since last tag**: Automatically detects tags and versions\n- [x] **Auto-categorizes**: Added / Fixed / Changed / Removed / Documentation / Performance / Testing / Build / CI/CD / Maintenance\n- [x] **Properly formatted CHANGELOG.md**: Follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/) format\n- [x] **Tested on real repos**: 2 projects tested (Isaac RAG, FinMind)\n- [x] **README**: 3-step setup instructions\n\n### 📦 What's Included\n\n**Two Implementations**:\n- `generate-changelog.sh` - Bash version (recommended)\n- `generate_changelog.py` - Python version\n\n**Features**:\n- Automatic version detection from git tags\n- Unreleased section for commits after latest tag\n- Conventional commit parsing (feat, fix, docs, etc.)\n- Comparison links between versions\n- Keep a Changelog format\n\n**Categories**:\n| Prefix | Category |\n|--------|----------|\n| feat, feature | Added |\n| fix | Fixed |\n| style, refactor | Changed |\n| docs | Documentation |\n| perf | Performance |\n| test | Testing |\n| build | Build |\n| ci | CI/CD |\n| chore | Maintenance |\n\n### 🚀 Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# 1. Clone\ngit clone https://github.com/ljapptest-art/generate-changelog.git\ncd generate-changelog\n\n# 2. Make executable\nchmod +x generate-changelog.sh\n\n# 3. Run\n./generate-changelog.sh\n```\n\n### 📋 Output Example\n\n```markdown\n# Changelog\n\n## [Unreleased]\n\n### Added\n- New authentication system ([`abc1234`](https://github.com/user/repo/commit/abc1234))\n\n## [1.0.0] - 2026-03-27\n\n### Added\n- Initial release ([`def5678`](https://github.com/user/repo/commit/def5678))\n\n### Fixed\n- Bug fix ([`ghi9012`](https://github.com/user/repo/commit/ghi9012))\n```\n\n### 🔗 Links\n\n- **Code**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/generate-changelog\n- **README**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/generate-changelog/blob/main/README.md\n\nReady for review! 🎉","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:24:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139879822","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wzlN","author":{"login":"TiagoAlmeidaS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"👋 Working on this. Will submit a PR shortly.\n\n*Automated by [OpenCode](https://opencode.ai) agent*","createdAt":"2026-03-27T04:01:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4139989325","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72xknL","author":{"login":"D2758695161"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-03-27T04:56:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","rea