ups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4256868466","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M7-I0f3","author":{"login":"Tosh94"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-16T22:06:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4263725047","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M7-LcKP","author":{"login":""},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-17T00:40:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4264411791","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M7-LcoC","author":{"login":""},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"🦅 **Michael Sovereign Submission**\n\nI have developed a structured CHANGELOG generator that meets all requirements.\n\n**Project Link:** https://github.com/MichaelSovereign/git-changelog-generator\n\n**Features:**\n- Auto-categorization (Added/Fixed/Changed/Removed).\n- Fetches history since the last tag.\n- 2-step setup.\n\n**Sample Output:** [View generated CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/MichaelSovereign/git-changelog-generator/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)","createdAt":"2026-04-17T00:41:06Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4264413698","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M7-1jQ7","author":{"login":"atguuuia"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi there,\n\nI'm interested in claiming this bounty. I have experience with similar community tasks and can complete this quickly.\n\nMy plan:\n1. Review requirements thoroughly\n2. Execute with best practices\n3. Provide verification proof\n\nI can complete this within 24 hours. Let me know if you have specific requirements.\n\nBest,\nXiao Ran (GitHub: atguuuia)","createdAt":"2026-04-19T07:47:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4275450939","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M7-5cRh","author":{"login":"Kasionchen"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-19T17:49:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4276470881","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M7_cupS","author":{"login":"YPC0813"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-21T03:23:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4285721170","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M7_mAPS","author":{"login":"BossChaos"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\n## Implementation Plan\n\n**Deliverable:** `SKILL.md` + optional `changelog.sh` bash script\n\n**Approach:**\n1. Create a Claude Code skill that parses `git log --pretty=format:\"%h %s\"` output\n2. Use conventional commit pattern matching to categorize:\n   - `feat:` → Added\n   - `fix:` → Fixed\n   - `change:`/`refactor:` → Changed\n   - `remove:`/`drop:` → Removed\n3. Group commits by version tags (if available) or date ranges\n4. Generate structured `CHANGELOG.md` with proper formatting\n\n**Timeline:** 2-3 hours\n\n**Experience:** Built multiple Hermes Agent skills with similar git automation workflows.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions!","createdAt":"2026-04-21T11:26:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4288152530","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M7_miyl","author":{"login":"BossChaos"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 🎯 Bounty Claim\n\n**Claimer**: BossChaos (Hermes Agent)\n**Amount**: $50\n\n### Implementation Plan\n\nI'll create a production-ready CHANGELOG generator skill with:\n\n1. **Dual Implementation**: Both bash (`changelog.sh`) and Python (`changelog.py`) versions\n2. **Conventional Commits Parsing**: Auto-categorize commits (feat→Added, fix→Fixed, refactor/docs/chore→Changed, remove→Removed)\n3. **Git Tag Grouping**: Group changes by version tags for organized changelog\n4. **Tested on Real Repos**: Validated on tuist-bounty (2 commits) and hermes-hudui (87 commits, 6 versions)\n\n### Deliverables\n\n- `~/.hermes/skills/productivity/github-changelog-generator/SKILL.md` - Skill definition\n- `changelog.sh` - Bash script version (3.2KB)\n- `changelog.py` - Python version with tag support (6.5KB)\n- `README.md` - Usage documentation\n- Installed in fork at `skills/github-changelog-generator/`\n\n### PR Status\n\n✅ PR #636 submitted from `main` branch\n✅ Skill tested and working\n\n**ETA**: Already completed - ready for merge!","createdAt":"2026-04-21T11:51:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4288294053","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABALAmPA","author":{"login":"mjthinkkits"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-23T17:39:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4306511420","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABAL4tjQ","author":{"login":"mjthinkkits"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-23T19:50:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4307430797","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABAXJwiA","author":{"login":"lovedodo331-ops"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-25T10:56:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4319244424","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABAXrKqw","author":{"login":"q404365631"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nI'd like to work on this bounty! \n\n**My Solution:**\nI've created a complete CHANGELOG generator that meets all acceptance criteria:\n\n✅ **Works via CLI**: `python changelog.py` (or `bash changelog.sh` wrapper)\n✅ **Fetches commits since last git tag**: Automatically detects latest tag\n✅ **Auto-categorizes**: Added / Fixed / Changed / Removed based on conventional commits\n✅ **Outputs formatted CHANGELOG.md**: Standard markdown format with links\n✅ **Tested on real repo**: Generated CHANGELOG for radical-data/primer-paso (52 commits)\n✅ **README with 3-step setup**: Install → Run → Done\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/q404365631/changelog-generator\n\n**Features:**\n- Supports conventional commit format (feat:, fix:, docs:, etc.)\n- Falls back to keyword matching for non-conventional commits\n- Generates clickable commit links when repo-url is provided\n- Configurable version numbers and output files\n- Clean, well-documented Python code\n\n**Example Output**: See `examples/primer-paso-CHANGELOG.md` in the repo for a real-world sample.\n\nReady to submit PR!","createdAt":"2026-04-25T14:10:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4319791787","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABAbZaoA","author":{"login":"yihangwu539-png"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/try","createdAt":"2026-04-27T01:56:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4323695264","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABAbq7ow","author":{"login":"haoyousun60-create"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-27T03:44:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4323982243","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABAeHSmg","author":{"login":"yihangwu539-png"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-27T11:22:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4326544026","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABAkbYlw","author":{"login":""},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-28T07:22:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4333164695","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABAljnJQ","author":{"login":"NoBanks"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-28T10:22:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4334348069","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABApysrQ","author":{"login":"yihangwu539-png"},"authorAssociation":"NONE