NE","body":"Submitted PR #930 for this bounty: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/930\n\nSummary:\n- add changelog.sh to generate a structured CHANGELOG.md from git history\n- detect latest git tag and fall back to full history when no tags exist\n- categorize commits into Added, Fixed, Changed, Removed\n- document setup in 3 steps and include sample output\n\nLocal verification:\n- bash -n changelog.sh\n- bash changelog.sh\n- generated CHANGELOG.md on this repository\n\nPlease review for bounty payout. I can update quickly if anything needs adjustment.","createdAt":"2026-05-12T00:09:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4426172666","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABB9Qzgw","author":{"login":"laolaoqi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'd like to work on this. Here's my technical plan:\n\n**Technical Plan:**\n- Python script `changelog-gen.py` with `/generate-changelog` support\n- Parses git log since last tag using `git describe --tags`\n- Auto-categorizes commits by conventional commit type (feat→Added, fix→Fixed, chore/docs→Changed, remove→Removed)\n- Outputs clean `CHANGELOG.md` with version header and date\n- Tested against a real repo with sample output included in PR\n- README with 3-step setup\n\n**Experience:** Built similar tools for multiple open-source projects. Strong git/CLI automation skills.\n\n**Timeline:** PR within 24 hours.\n\n**Payment Address:** `0x6c21794E27C34E93cd0049918d04Da58FC72595c`","createdAt":"2026-05-12T00:44:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4426314627","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABB9RvwA","author":{"login":"Thanhdn1984"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/o