atedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4442408349","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCMv73A","author":{"login":"Snooz1e"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-13T15:21:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4442553308","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCNgGgA","author":{"login":"extremeWu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-13T16:51:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4443342464","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCNsEAg","author":{"login":"emre-koc"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-13T17:15:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4443538434","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCN2PFQ","author":{"login":"wdnmdtonyma"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nSubmitted PR #1246 with the implementation. Includes both a Claude Code SKILL.md and a standalone bash script. Tested on two real repos (devtools-site and asyncapi/cli with 346 commits).","createdAt":"2026-05-13T17:34:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4443705109","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCOLL6g","author":{"login":"realkoreanbeef"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-13T18:21:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4444048362","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCOTYLA","author":{"login":"fansifei"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-13T18:39:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4444182572","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCOTrUg","author":{"login":"fansifei"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Test Results\n\nTested this script on the claude-builders-bounty repo itself:\n\n```\n$ bash changelog.sh\nCHANGELOG generated\n  Added: 1, Fixed: 0, Changed: 1, Removed: 0\n```\n\nGenerated CHANGELOG:\n```markdown\n# Changelog\n\n## [0.1.0] - 2026-05-14\n\n### Added\n- feat: initial README with bounty board\n\n### Changed\n- Initial commit\n```\n\nAlso tested on my `online-tools` project (8 commits):\n- Correctly identified all feature additions and fixes\n\nThe script works with or without git tags, handles edge cases (empty repos, no conventional commits), and generates proper Markdown.","createdAt":"2026-05-13T18:39:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4444187474","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCOa-3Q","author":{"login":"extremeWu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nPR submitted: #1243\n\nA structured CHANGELOG generator from git history:\n- Auto-categorizes commits: Added, Fixed, Changed, Removed, Docs, Testing, CI/CD\n- Conventional commit aware + emoji support\n- GitHub commit links\n- Pure Python 3, zero dependencies\n\nUsage:\n```bash\npython3 changelog.sh              # Auto-detect, generate CHANGELOG.md\npython3 changelog.sh --from v1.0  # From specific tag\npython3 changelog.sh --stdout     # Print to stdout\n```","createdAt":"2026-05-13T18:55:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4444307165","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCOnoTA","author":{"login":"politas180"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-13T19:23:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4444514380","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCO3lsg","author":{"login":"daletyler1737"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"`/opire try`","createdAt":"2026-05-13T20:00:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4444775858","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCP0Lcg","author":{"login":"fansifei"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-13T22:45:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4445768562","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCP0x8A","author":{"login":"fansifei"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #1276 with changelog.sh script and sample output.","createdAt":"2026-05-13T22:47:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4445778416","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCP01IA","author":{"login":"extremeWu"},"authorAssociation