OG generator.\n\nFeatures:\n- Zero dependencies (bash + git only)\n- Conventional Commits + keyword fallback categorization\n- GitHub commit links auto-generated\n- Tested on cli/cli (GitHub official CLI) with sample output\n- 3-step setup per requirements","createdAt":"2026-05-20T10:39:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4497499858","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDBRxSw","author":{"login":"tariqaq"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-20T10:56:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4497633611","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDBrhyA","author":{"login":"KovD3v"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-20T11:48:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4498055624","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDB6pTQ","author":{"login":"Adamchaua"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-20T12:17:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4498303309","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDCD6qA","author":{"login":"Adamchaua"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR: #1827\n\nChanges included:\n- Added `changelog.sh` to generate a structured `CHANGELOG.md` from git history.\n- Supports commits since the latest git tag, or the full history when no tag exists.\n- Auto-categorizes commits into Added, Fixed, Changed, and Removed.\n- Added README setup instructions in 3 steps or fewer.\n- Included `SAMPLE_CHANGELOG.md` generated from this repository.\n\nVerification:\n- Ran `bash -n changelog.sh`.\n- Ran `./changelog.sh SAMPLE_CHANGELOG.md`.\n- Ran `git diff --check`.\n\nPayment wallet:\n`0x1ecab01075f3bdf1b56b7d849c8e28ef88943624`\n\nIf the result saves review time or exceeds expectations, an optional tip is appreciated.","createdAt":"2026-05-20T12:37:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4498455208","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDCIPsQ","author":{"login":"alicyh"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-20T12:46:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4498526129","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDCI4VA","author":{"login":"alicyh"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try：https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1 ","createdAt":"2026-05-20T12:47:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4498536532","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDCS5DA","author":{"login":"vgtmy"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-20T13:07:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4498700556","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDDGgYg","author":{"login":"zqleslie"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-20T14:44:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":fals