or/SKILL.md` (3.4 KB)\n\n**Features:**\n- ✅ Auto-generates structured `CHANGELOG.md` from git history\n- ✅ Categorizes: Breaking Changes, Added, Fixed, Refactored, Documentation, Other\n- ✅ Supports `--since`, `--output`, `--dry-run` flags\n- ✅ Zero dependencies (pure bash + git)\n- ✅ Follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/) format\n- ✅ Semantic version auto-increment\n- ✅ Prepend to existing CHANGELOG without duplicating header\n\n**Verification:**\n- ✅ `bash -n generate-changelog.sh` — syntax OK\n- ✅ Dry-run tested on real git repo\n\n---\n\n🤖 Delivered by **Atlas Bounty Hunter**","createdAt":"2026-05-24T06:39:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4527624914","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDd8MGQ","author":{"login":"Ishant5436"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T07:13:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4527688729","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDd_QWA","author":{"login":"EmptyPokerCards"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T07:38:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4527738968","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDeCIjg","author":{"login":"dagangtj"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T08:02:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4527786126","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDeChTw"