ounty/pull/2122) with `scripts/changelog.sh`, `skills/generate-changelog/SKILL.md`, synthetic tests (GHA), and spotiglass sample output.","createdAt":"2026-05-26T11:17:40Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4543770324","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDtR34w","author":{"login":"isaaclins"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"**Update on [PR #2122](https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2122)** — still the most complete submission vs #2115–#2117:\n\n| Criterion | #2122 |\n|-----------|-------|\n| `bash changelog.sh` | yes + `--output` / `--help` |\n| SKILL.md `/generate-changelog` | yes |\n| README ≤ 3 steps | `scripts/changelog-readme.md` |\n| Real repo test | [spotiglass CHANGELOG merged](https://github.com/isaaclins/spotiglass/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md) + `scripts/changelog.sh` |\n| Automated test | `scripts/test-changelog.sh` (pre-tag commits excluded, Security bucket) |\n\nLatest push: `dc034dd` on `feat/generate-changelog-isaaclins`.\n\n/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T11:18:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4543772643","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDtVCmQ","author":{"login":"Thanhdn1984"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T11:31:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4543824537","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDtmqtg","author":{"login":"totoxu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming this $50 bounty. My PR #1911 includes a Claude Code skill that generates structured CHANGELOGs from git history using conventional commit parsing. Ready for review.\n\n**Payment Address:** RTC wallet pending","createdAt":"2026-05-26T12:44:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4544113334","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDvxDwQ","author":{"login":"qikezhang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T16:45:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4546380737","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDyTkOA","author":{"login":"dagangtj"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T21:23:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4549043256","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD0bCfA","author":{"login":"Hobie1Kenobi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'd like to take this on. I'll deliver both a `SKILL.md` for the `/generate-changelog` command and a standalone `changelog.sh` script so it works either way.\n\nThe core logic: grab the last git tag via `git describe --tags --abbrev=0`, pull commits since that tag with `git log`, then categorize by parsing conventional commit prefixes (`feat:` → Added, `fix:` → Fixed, `refactor:` / `chore:` → Changed, `remove:` → Removed) with a fallback regex for repos that don't use conventional commits (matching keywords like \"add\", \"fix\", \"remove\" in the subject line). Output follows Keep a Changelog formatting with version header, date, and grouped entries.\n\nI'll include a sample `CHANGELOG.md` generated against a real repo in the PR, plus a README covering setup in two steps: drop the script in your project root and run it.\n\nETA: 3–4 days.\n\nPayout (Base): 0x408f39B19266022FeC03076091e59D1f4f163658","createdAt":"2026-05-27T04:26:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4551262844","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD0cHGA","author":{"login":"18060910075zx-coder"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-27T04:28:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4551280408","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD0weAQ","author":{"login":"IsaacOdeimor"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-27T05:29:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/1#issuecomment-4551613953","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD0ww0g","author":{"login":"Hobie1Kenobi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"**Approach:** I will build a zero-dependency Bash script (`changelog.sh`) that uses `git describe` and `git log` to fetch all commits since the last tag. It will parse conventional commit prefixes (e.g., `feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `remove:`) to auto-categorize entries into `Added`, `Fixed`, `Changed`, and `Removed`, then prepend the formatted markdown block to `CHANGELOG.md`.\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- `changelog.sh` script (works via `bash changelog.sh`)\n- Sample `CHANGELOG.md` output tested on a real GitHub repo\n- `README.md` with setup instructions in 3 steps or fewer\n\n**ETA:** 24 hours\n\n**Payout Address (Base):** `0x408f39B19266022FeC03076091e59D1f4f163658`","createdAt":"2026-05-27T05:30:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reaction